    "description": "<h4>🚀 Enhancement</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure all IntendedFor matching params must match <a href=\"https://github.com/nipy/heudiconv/pull/860\">#860</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/mslw\">@mslw</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>🏠 Internal</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"deps\">gh-actions</a>: Bump codecov/codecov-action from 6 to 7 <a href=\"https://github.com/nipy/heudiconv/pull/857\">#857</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot%5Bbot%5D\">@dependabot[bot]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"deps\">gh-actions</a>: Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 <a href=\"https://github.com/nipy/heudiconv/pull/861\">#861</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot%5Bbot%5D\">@dependabot[bot]</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"deps\">gh-actions</a>: Bump actions/setup-python from 6 to 7 <a href=\"https://github.com/nipy/heudiconv/pull/862\">#862</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot%5Bbot%5D\">@dependabot[bot]</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📝 Documentation</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix RTD build: update build.os to ubuntu-24.04 <a href=\"https://github.com/nipy/heudiconv/pull/865\">#865</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/claude\">@claude</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/yarikoptic-gitmate\">@yarikoptic-gitmate</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Authors: 4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot%5Bbot%5D\">@dependabot[bot]</a></li>\n<li>Claude (<a href=\"https://github.com/claude\">@claude</a>)</li>\n<li>GitMate for @yarikoptic (<a href=\"https://github.com/yarikoptic-gitmate\">@yarikoptic-gitmate</a>)</li>\n<li>Michał Szczepanik (<a href=\"https://github.com/mslw\">@mslw</a>)</li>\n</ul>"
